{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57195","headline":"十四科头 佛与衆生不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 佛与衆生不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆生与佛无殊，大智不异於愚。\n何须向外求宝，身田自有明珠。\n正道邪道不二，了知凡圣同途。\n迷悟本无差别，湼盘生死一如。\n究竟攀缘空寂，惟求意想清虚。\n无有一法可得，翛然自入无余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}